THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
====================

Not everything in this repository was written for it. Every borrowed directory
keeps the upstream licence text next to its code, plus an UPSTREAM.md or NOTICE
saying where it came from and what was changed. MIT and Apache-2.0 both require
those files to travel with the copy: if you redistribute a skill folder, take
its licence file with it.

The list below was generated from the working tree on 2026-08-23, and every
upstream licence was verified against its source repository over the network on
the same day.

