Licence not established - read before redistributing
----------------------------------------------------

  .claude/skills/doc-coauthoring/  see its UPSTREAM.md
      Upstream ships no licence file for this one skill, while its eighteen
      siblings in the same repository do. No grant is asserted here.

  .claude/skills/building-an-exo/  see its ATTRIBUTION.md
      The frameworks are the authors' intellectual property by the skill's own
      words. An earlier metadata claim of "MIT" had no source behind it and was
      removed rather than kept.

Deliberately NOT in this repository
-----------------------------------

  Anthropic's document skills (docx, pdf, pptx, xlsx). Their licence forbids
  retaining copies outside Anthropic's Services, creating derivative works, and
  distribution to third parties; the upstream README calls them
  "source-available, not open source". They were removed - see
  _dropped-2026-08-22/office-skills-anthropic-proprietary/README.md. Skills
  bearing those four names in .claude/skills/ are written from scratch for this
  pack and are covered by the MIT grant above.

  Remotion (used by video-shotcraft and the overlay recipes) is BUSL and is not
  vendored: package.json declares it, npm install fetches it, and the licence
  reaches you directly from its author. Free below $1M ARR - measured against
  YOUR revenue, not anyone else's.
